{"id":"9cca4c00e961ff80","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-geometrization.md","title":"Thurston Geometrization (Perelman)","display":"thm-geometrization — Thurston Geometrization (Perelman)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-geometrization","aliases":["58-thm-geometrization"],"display":"thm-geometrization — Thurston Geometrization (Perelman)","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-geometrization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-geometrization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-geometrization — Thurston Geometrization (Perelman)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"230b6c3bb3938a47\" href=\"?note=230b6c3bb3938a47\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md\">../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e800aa519680c23\" href=\"?note=0e800aa519680c23\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md\">../batch08/58-df-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>（候选闭三维流形）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S\\)</span>（本定理的流形前提）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}\">\\(\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}\\)</span>（先素分解、再作 JSJ 分解的谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}\">\\(\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}\\)</span>（分块承载模型几何的谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\)</span>（八种 Thurston 模型几何, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"230b6c3bb3938a47\" href=\"?note=230b6c3bb3938a47\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md\">../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}geometrization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S(M)\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\\exists\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}(M,\\mathcal T,\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\;\n\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}(N_i,G)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}geometrization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S(M)\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\\exists\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}(M,\\mathcal T,\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})\\land\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\;\n\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}(N_i,G)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>先沿嵌入球面作素分解，再沿不可压缩环面作 JSJ 分解；几何化结论作用于所得分块，而非每个不可约素因子本身。</li>\n<li>八种几何由上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\)</span> 统一注册，避免重复或漏项。</li>\n<li>Perelman 的带手术 Ricci 流完成了 Thurston 几何化纲领所需的证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md","status":"resolved","id":"230b6c3bb3938a47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0e800aa519680c23","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md","status":"resolved","id":"230b6c3bb3938a47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S$（八种 Thurston 模型几何, see [[../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}geometrization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S(M)\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\mathcal T\\,\\exists\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i<n}\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}(M,\\mathcal T,\\langle N_i\\rangle_{i<n})\\land\n\\forall i<n\\;\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S\\;\n\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}(N_i,G)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1524,"backlinks":[{"id":"66ba1e952f22cdd1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedConnectedOrientableSmooth3Manifold}_S$, $\\operatorname{PrimeJSJDecomposition}$, and $\\operatorname{AdmitsGeometry}$ are the predicates used in [[58-thm-geometrization]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-geometrization.md|58-thm-geometrization]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["230b6c3bb3938a47","0e800aa519680c23"]}